Thought: Test a robust central tendency on a larger pool to see if median outperforms weighted on pool2.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool2"}

Thought: Test weighted combination on the smaller pool1 using the same inverse_error weights (w4) to see if a tighter pool improves the score.

Action: evaluate_strategy

